# Piston installation

```bash
docker run --privileged -v './piston:/piston' -dit -p 2000:2000 --name piston_api ghcr.io/engineer-man/piston
```

```powershell
docker run --privileged -v "./piston:/piston" -dit -p 2000:2000 --name piston_api ghcr.io/engineer-man/piston
```

Make sure the piston directory exists before running.
